WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.962
Check four.

2
00:00:00.962 --> 00:00:03.251
The gateway's policy is in detection,

3
00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.913
and the kit wrote the switch to
prevention into a plan file.

4
00:00:06.913 --> 00:00:08.237
Who runs it, and when?

5
00:00:08.237 --> 00:00:10.438
The kit, on its next weekly run?

6
00:00:10.438 --> 00:00:15.026
The application owner, after the
false-positive review, in a change window?

7
00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:17.025
Azure Policy, automatically?

8
00:00:17.025 --> 00:00:19.680
Or nobody, because detection is enough?
